/2320500/extras/80af8218073ac5e3405bfcea0f25446a.webm?t=1746810104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320500/extras/80af8218073ac5e3405bfcea0f25446a.mp4?t=1746810104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Interactions between Mich\u00e9l the violinist and Chlo\u00e9 the pianist can be enjoyed with beautiful character illustrations.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320500/extras/6b90ad79cf2ab84899ce5e2a76f2cf4c.poster.avif?t=1746810104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320500/extras/6b90ad79cf2ab84899ce5e2a76f2cf4c.webm?t=1746810104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>To break the multiple &quot;curses&quot; in the mansion, the player may need to hold items in both hands. There may be &quot;curses&quot; that require musical knowledge, making music one of the central themes of the game. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320500/extras/baf81d124e44e2777e10cdc216628142.poster.avif?t=1746810104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320500/extras/baf81d124e44e2777e10cdc216628142.webm?t=1746810104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The world is set in 19th century Europe, with aesthetics and interiors reflecting the era.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320500/extras/fe9e97a36b6515c32c15d32ec6cbd553.avif?t=1746810104\" /></span><br>We are all looking forward to your arrival.",
